  "steps": [
    "Spices - Salt, 1/2 tsp red chilli powder, 1/2 tsp garam masala, 1/2 tsp coriander powder, 1/2 tsp sugar.",
    "Add 1 tsp ghee, bay leaf, elaichi, jeera, green chillies and garlic to a pan. Sauté for 2 mins.",
    "Add onion and sauté for 2-3 mins.",
    "Add this all to a blender with dhaniya and grind into a smooth paste.",
    "Add this mixture that we grinded to a bowl along with greek yogurt and mix until smooth.",
    "Sauté some paneer for 3-4 mins until golden-brown and add the gravy we prepared to this. Adjust with a little bit of water.",
    "Add sugar and let it simmer for 5 mins and its ready!",
    "Mix all the above together and its ready! You can add lemon later if you want otherwise it would leave water."
  ],
